Package: cpgdirection
Type: Package
Title: Predict the Direction of CpG-Gene Expression Associations
Version: 2.2.3
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tsachi", "Ein-Dor", email = "teindor@runi.ac.il",
           role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: Assigns a direction to the association between DNA methylation at a
    CpG site and the expression of a nearby gene, for CpGs that have no measured
    expression quantitative trait methylation (eQTM) record. Predictions come
    from a precomputed table of 1,603,777 CpG-gene pairs covering 604,456 CpGs,
    derived from a gradient-boosted model built on genomic context and local
    catalogue structure. Each call returns a direction, a calibrated probability,
    an evidence tier and an expected accuracy, and abstains where the evidence is
    insufficient. Predictions estimate direction conditional on the CpG being an
    eQTM; they do not establish that an effect exists.
